GemCraft Legacy Collection — The Forgotten Auto Mana Trainer 0.1.1
Automatic mana refills for The Forgotten in GemCraft Legacy Collection. Launch the game, enter a map and press Start in the trainer.
The trainer continuously reads your current and maximum mana. Whenever mana drops below 50% of the available pool, it automatically refills it to 95% of the current maximum. Both the threshold and refill target adjust when you expand the pool in the game.
Features
- Live display of current and maximum mana, refreshed every 0.25 seconds.
- Automatic refills: below 50% → 95%.
- Start and Stop controls.
- Automatic game process detection and object detection again after map changes.
- No manual memory addresses or mana values required.
- 10 interface languages selectable by flag: Polish, English, German, French, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese and Hindi.
- Remembers your selected language.
- Standalone EXE for 64-bit Windows, approximately 7.4 MB. No Python or additional library installation required.
How to use
1. Launch GemCraft Legacy Collection and select The Forgotten.
2. Enter a map.
3. Run GemCraft_The_Forgotten_Auto_Mana_Trainer_0.1.1.exe and press Start.
4. Press Stop or close the trainer to stop automatic refills.
The trainer refills mana within your current maximum pool. It is intended for The Forgotten in Legacy Collection. The standalone EXE has been confirmed working by the user on Windows.
